# TUI-DESIGN-3 §9 "keys never in logs": a key typed into the one-key field shows as `•` cells and the counter row names the length only;
# Ctrl-C leaves; run-smoke.sh asserts the typed bytes are in no frame and no file
expect \x1b\[\?25l
expect OpenRouter API key
sleep 0.3
send sk-fake-zzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz
expect •{20}
expect chars · Enter saves
sleep 0.3
mark typed
send \x03
eof
